  "description": "Add movement and energy to your designs with this orange, blue, and yellow diagonal stripe seamless pattern. The striking mix of vibrant orange, refreshing blue, and sunny yellow creates a bold striped background with a playful retro feel. Its repeating design is ideal for adding colorful details to digital artwork, printable stationery, packaging, and a wide range of creative projects.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Digital paper and printable backgrounds\n• Scrapbooking and journaling\n• Fabric and apparel prints\n• Birthday party decorations\n• Gift wrap and product packaging\n• Invitations and greeting cards\n• Bold branding and social media graphics",
